---
/** Slide 07 · The ask — greenlight one bottleneck. */
---

<section data-slot="07" data-variant="awm-p1" class="deck-section">
  <span class="deck-kicker">07 / 09</span>

  <div>
    <p class="deck-eyebrow mb-3">The internal decision</p>
    <h2 class="deck-h2">
      Greenlight one bottleneck: <span class="deck-gradient">the grants front, corpus-first.</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="deck-grid mt-2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));">
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-chip">START</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.15vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">Stand up the grant corpus + snippet library + deadline calendar. Prove it on the live windows.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-chip">MEASURE</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.15vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">Both axes: hours saved <em>and</em> asks newly submitted. Then expand front by front.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-card flex flex-col gap-2">
      <span class="deck-chip">GUARDRAIL</span>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.15vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">Humans stay on everything outward — sent, published, submitted. Tool budget is noise against a single caught window.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
